{
  "info": {
    "name": "Saligan AI API",
    "description": "REST API for Saligan AI (Philippine legal research + document drafting assistant).\n\n## Authentication\n\nThis API uses **Sanctum SPA session auth (cookies)** — there are no bearer tokens.\n\n1. Send **Get CSRF Cookie** (`GET /sanctum/csrf-cookie`) — Postman stores the `XSRF-TOKEN` cookie in its cookie jar.\n2. Send **Login** (`POST /api/login`) — the session cookie is stored automatically.\n3. Every state-changing request now automatically sends `X-XSRF-TOKEN` + `Accept: application/json` via the collection pre-request script.\n\nUpdate the `baseUrl` collection variable if your API runs on another host/port (default `http://localhost:8000`).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Most endpoints require an **active subscription** (`active_subscription` middleware).\n- `POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages` returns a **Server-Sent Events (SSE)** stream, not JSON.\n- Admin endpoints require an **admin** account.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "9d7d5d1e-4e5a-4f3b-8c2a-1a2b3c4d5e6f"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Public auth endpoints plus the session/CSRF setup.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get CSRF Cookie",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie",
            "description": "Sets the XSRF-TOKEN cookie used by all state-changing requests. Send this once (or whenever a request returns a 419)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}/register",
            "description": "Create a new account. Returns the user resource and starts a session."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}/login",
            "description": "Authenticate and start a cookie session.",
            "test": "pm.test('login succeeds', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}/user"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}/logout",
            "description": "Invalidate the session."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}/forgot-password"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"new-password\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"new-password\",\n  \"token\": \"reset-token-from-email\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}/reset-password"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
